(6915638, 1041898, 103142, '<td valign="top">Haha, I like the idea, and I do think it fits the challenge. I think you did the best you could with the time of day. I wish the reflections on the rocks could have been taken down quite a bit -- they''re so bright compared to the rest, it makes it feel quite busy. I wonder if a polarizer would have taken down the reflections on the rocks? (That really is a question -- I know it will take down leaves, not sure about rocks. :)</td>', 'Haha, I like the idea, and I do think it fits the challenge. I think you did the best you could with the time of day. I wish the reflections on the rocks could have been taken down quite a bit -- they''re so bright compared to the rest, it makes it feel quite busy. I wonder if a polarizer would have taken down the reflections on the rocks? (That really is a question -- I know it will take down leaves, not sure about rocks. :)', '2012-11-29 07:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
