(6915703, 1042147, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The attention to detail is fabulous from the smaller bubbles on the floor to the soap bubble pastel colors on the edges of the big soap bubble makes this all the more believable. I don''t know if it is truly a ''you''re doing it wrong'' when this could be a monumental discovery of a green way to travel:-):-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The attention to detail is fabulous from the smaller bubbles on the floor to the soap bubble pastel colors on the edges of the big soap bubble makes this all the more believable. I don''t know if it is truly a ''you''re doing it wrong'' when this could be a monumental discovery of a green way to travel:-):-)', '2012-11-29 09:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
