(6915707, 1042061, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>There is a lot going on in the picture that normally an audience would be hard pressed to find where to focus on as a main subject. The addition of the paint brush paint-stripping all the color along it''s path is what makes this photo composition. The idea of ''taking away'' the holiday cheer comes across clearly. My only critique is that I wish that there were more holiday decorations than just the harvest pumpkins/berry wreath on the table to <u>further strengthen</u> the idea of holiday warmth being ''deconstructed''.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. There is a lot going on in the picture that normally an audience would be hard pressed to find where to focus on as a main subject. The addition of the paint brush paint-stripping all the color along it''s path is what makes this photo composition. The idea of ''taking away'' the holiday cheer comes across clearly. My only critique is that I wish that there were more holiday decorations than just the harvest pumpkins/berry wreath on the table to further strengthen the idea of holiday warmth being ''deconstructed''.', '2012-11-29 09:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915708, 1042103, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I remember me sliding down once on something like this, so this kid is doing the wrong thing!</td>', 'Nice image. I remember me sliding down once on something like this, so this kid is doing the wrong thing!', '2012-11-29 09:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
