(6915720, 1042146, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The concept of a home drill as a way to pierce the ears --is about as painful to see as it looks. Ouch the the nth degree! Definitely a ''you''re doing it wrong'' moment. This too makes me squirm that I can''t ''sit'' long enough to offer a detailed critique on other than the lighting is a bit odd in a few places (such as the shadow blobs on the fingers).</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The concept of a home drill as a way to pierce the ears --is about as painful to see as it looks. Ouch the the nth degree! Definitely a ''you''re doing it wrong'' moment. This too makes me squirm that I can''t ''sit'' long enough to offer a detailed critique on other than the lighting is a bit odd in a few places (such as the shadow blobs on the fingers).', '2012-11-29 09:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
