(6921210, 1041476, 152252, '<td valign="top">I thought that was super funny and I was wondering how you pulled that off. Was it arranged or was he really just fishing? :) (if it''s a secret that''s okay)</td>', 'I thought that was super funny and I was wondering how you pulled that off. Was it arranged or was he really just fishing? :) (if it''s a secret that''s okay)', '2012-12-03 13:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6921269, 1041476, 49511, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by beatabg:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought that was super funny and I was wondering how you pulled that off. Was it arranged or was he really just fishing? :) (if it''s a secret that''s okay) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I arranged it from 3 diff. photo''s; the fishsellers were on the market and saw me take some shots [talked to them and even emailed this to him because he liked the idea], the fisherman caught that fish but in another shot so I just let the fish fly as if it hangs on the line [there is no line].<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1043704" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043704.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043704.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043704.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1043705" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043705.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043705.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043705.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1043706" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043706.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043706.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/49511/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1043706.jpg"/></a> <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-12-03 15:04:56.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by beatabg: I thought that was super funny and I was wondering how you pulled that off. Was it arranged or was he really just fishing? :) (if it''s a secret that''s okay)   I arranged it from 3 diff. photo''s; the fishsellers were on the market and saw me take some shots [talked to them and even emailed this to him because he liked the idea], the fisherman caught that fish but in another shot so I just let the fish fly as if it hangs on the line [there is no line].    ', '2012-12-03 14:59:20.000000', '2012-12-03 15:04:56.000000', 0),
